# The TypeScript compiler vendored into the distribution. Fetched by
# `tools/vendor_typescript.py` at release time and shipped inside the sdist and
# wheel, but not carried in the repository: it is 12 MB of generated JavaScript
# that would land again, in full, on every version bump.
lachesis/frontends/typescript/vendor/

.claude/worktrees/
*.md
# Local secrets (PyPI token, etc.) — never commit
.env
.env.*
